# The one image ignore rule for the Go stack (constitution, Built artifacts): every image built with
# src/ as its context leaves out tests, test data, evals and the packaging itself.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/evals/
tests/
deploy/
**/.git
**/*.md
# ...except what a program embeds: scripts/generate.sh copies it into gen/ beside the program.
!*/cmd/*/gen/**
